===Etymology===
{{com+|sv|barn|sjukdom|t1=child|t2=disease}}. {{etydate|1734|ref={{R:svenska.se|SO}}}}, possibly after {{cal|sv|de|Kinderkrankheit|notext=1}} (16th c.)<!--e.g. Wirsung: Arzney-Buch-->. Compare also {{cog|da|børnesygdom}}, {{cog|no|barnesykdom}}.

